- Influence the evolution of state variables
- Represent decisions, actions, or control signals
- Are the "levers" we can pull to achieve objectives

Examples of control inputs:
- Task assignment, resource allocation, priority settings
- Power levels, speed settings, flow rates
- Investment amounts, rebalance weights
- Control signals, actuator commands

